# Contact-form delivery. Full walkthrough: docs/SETUP.md
#
# Every channel configured below is attempted, and the form succeeds if ANY of
# them lands. Configure one or both. With none set the site still builds and
# the form still renders — it fails gracefully and offers its mailto fallback.
#
# Nothing here costs money and neither provider asks for a card.
#
# None of these may be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_. That ships the secret in the
# client bundle to every visitor.

# --- Discord: instant ping in a channel you already watch ------------------
# Free. Server Settings -> Integrations -> Webhooks -> New Webhook -> Copy
# Webhook URL. Treat this URL as a credential: anyone holding it can post
# into that channel.
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=

# --- Email: the archive, and one-tap Reply straight to the lead ------------
# Resend free tier is 3,000/month, 100/day. https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Inbox that receives enquiries. On Resend's free tier (no verified domain)
# this MUST be the address that owns the Resend account, or delivery is
# rejected. Free-tier mail lands in spam periodically — check that folder.
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=

# Sender address. Stays onboarding@resend.dev until a domain is verified.
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=onboarding@resend.dev
